veal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  lymph node  The lymph node is bisected and entirely frozen in FX 1  now  submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remaining adipose tissue is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      C  Received fresh  labeled  right breast skin   are 3 pieces of tan pink skin  with moderate attached fibroadipose tissue aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm   No lesions are apparent on the surface of the skin  Representative sections are  submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      Immunohistochemical and in situ hybridization tests performed at Massachusetts  General Hospital have been developed and their performance characteristics  determined by the Immunohistochemistry Laboratories in the Department of  Pathology at Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or  approved by the U S Food and Drug Administration  FDA   the FDA has determined  that such clearance or approval is not necessary       PART A  BREAST MASTECTOMY  RIGHT  PART B  SENTINEL LYMPH NODE EXCISION  RIGHT AXILLA  PART C  SKIN EXCISION  RIGHT BREAST       report_end  , Not Done.
